/td>\n<td>(0,0)(0,1)(1,0)(1,1)</td>\n<td>1</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>(2,2)</td>\n<td>(2,2)</td>\n<td>2</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>(3,3)</td>\n<td>(3,3)(3,4)</td>\n<td>3</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>DFS 从 (0,0) 出发，递归访问四个方向，将整个左上角的陆地块全部标记为 <code>&#39;0&#39;</code>。然后扫描继续，在 (2,2) 发现第二个岛，在 (3,3) 发现第三个岛。</p>\n<h3 id=\"bfs-中的关键细节\">BFS 中的关键细节</h3><p>BFS 版本中，<code>grid[nr][nc] = &quot;0&quot;</code> 必须在入队时立即执行，而不是出队时执行。如果在出队时才标记，同一个格子可能被多次加入队列，导致不必要的重复处理。</p>\n<h3 id=\"网格搜索的四方向模板\">网格搜索的四方向模板</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const directions = [&#10;  [1, 0],&#10;  [-1, 0],&#10;  [0, 1],&#10;  [0, -1],&#10;];&#10;&#10;for (const [dr, dc] of directions) {&#10;  const nr = r + dr;&#10;  const nc = c + dc;&#10;  if (nr &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; nr &lt; rows &amp;&amp; nc &gt;= 0 &amp;&amp; nc &lt; cols) {&#10;    // 处理相邻格子&#10;  }&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> directions</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">],</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dr</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">dc</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">of</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> directions) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nr</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> r </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dr;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> nc</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> c </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> dc;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (nr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nr </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> rows </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> &#x26;&#x26;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> nc </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> cols) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">    // 处理相邻格子</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><p>这个模板适用于几乎所有网格搜索题目。如果需要八方向搜索，只需增加对角线方向。</p>\n<h2 id=\"复杂度分析\">复杂度分析</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>维度</th>\n<th>DFS</th>\n<th>BFS</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>时间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(m×n)</td>\n<td>O(m×n)</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>空间复杂度</td>\n<td>O(m×n) 栈深</td>\n<td>O(min(m,n)) 队列</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p><strong>时间复杂度详解：</strong> 每个格子最多被访问两次：一次在主循环中被检查，一次在 DFS/BFS 中被标记。总操作 O(m×n)。</p>\n<p><strong>空间复杂度详解：</strong> DFS 的栈深度在最坏情况下（整个网格都是陆地）为 O(m×n)。BFS 的队列大小为当前搜索「边界」的长度，对于矩形网格，边界最大为 O(min(m,n))。因此在空间上 BFS 更优。对于非常大的网格（如 300×300 全陆地），DFS 可能栈溢出，此时应选择 BFS。</p>\n<p>岛屿数量是图搜索/网格搜索的模板题。掌握此题后，可以轻松应对岛屿最大面积（LC #695）、被围绕的区域（LC #130）、太平洋大西洋水流（LC #417）等变体。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"LeetCode 200 岛屿数量","id":"leetcode-200-岛屿数量"},{"level":2,"text":"题目描述","id":"题目描述"},{"level":2,"text":"解题思路","id":"解题思路"},{"level":3,"text":"核心思路：连通分量计数","id":"核心思路-连通分量计数"},{"level":2,"text":"代码实现","id":"代码实现"},{"level":3,"text":"方法一：DFS","id":"方法一-dfs"},{"level":3,"text":"方法二：BFS","id":"方法二-bfs"},{"level":3,"text":"执行过程示例","id":"执行过程示例"},{"level":3,"text":"BFS 中的关键细节","id":"bfs-中的关键细节"},{"level":3,"text":"网格搜索的四方向模板","id":"网格搜索的四方向模板"},{"level":2,"text":"复杂度分析","id":"复杂度分析"}],"prev":{"title":"LeetCode 236 二叉树的最近公共祖先","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0236-lowest-common-ancestor"},"next":{"title":"LeetCode 207 课程表","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/leetcode-practice/medium-tree-graph/lc0207-course-schedule"}}